{"title":"Conference Report and Intelligence Briefing: ECE/ECAH/EGen2026","link":"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-ece-ecah-egen2026/","date":1792141265000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Iafor-London-188-1500-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"ECE/ECAH/EGen2026 Conference Report\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Iafor-London-188-1500-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Iafor-London-188-1500-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Iafor-London-188-1500-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Iafor-London-188-1500-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Iafor-London-188-1500-300x300.jpg 300w\" />ECE/ECAH/EGen2026 was held in London, United Kingdom, from July 09-13, 2026, and drew 629 attendees from 80 countries and 350 affiliations to examine a world increasingly shaped by overlapping crises from an interdisciplinary perspective.\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-ece-ecah-egen2026/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"745d4b45ace658b66a06706dfbd4826d63e102d791cd5a558a2c3659e64bbb89","category":"Interdisciplinary"}